ord="password">Show</button></span></label><div class="form-row between"><label class="check-label"><input type="checkbox" name="remember"> Keep me signed in</label><span class="small-note">Secure access</span></div><button class="button primary full" type="submit"><span>Sign in</span><span class="button-spinner"></span></button></form><div class="login-foot">Protected workspace <span>·</span> EMS 1.0</div></div></section></main><script src="<?=e(app_url('assets/js/app.js'))?>"></script></body></html>
